/*!
 * @defgroup SPDIF_TX_Driver_Static_Configuration SPDIF_TX Driver Static Configuration
 * @{
  Static Configuration provides an easy and convenient way for application to configure the device during driver's open
  call. When an application provides custom static configuration file, then according to the setting provided driver initializes
  the device during driver's open call. If application fails to provide any custom configuration file, then by default S/PDIF TX device
  driver does not perform any static configuration.
 */

